# O-jarvis Shell: copy this file to ~/.config/o-jarvis/.env, chmod 600 it, then fill in.
# At start, the engine copies these keys into the system keyring; empty values are ignored.
# The O-jarvis app can also take them (first-launch welcome, or Réglages › Clés).
# Never commit the filled file.

# Required. Meta Model API (https://dev.meta.ai): Muse Spark 1.3, Muse Wonder 1.0,
# Muse Voice Transcribe 1.0 and SAM 3.1.
MODEL_API_KEY=

# Optional. Baseten (https://www.baseten.co): Muse Spark Open, Meta's open-weight model,
# served by Baseten. It takes over when Muse Spark does not answer, and answers every
# request after `/modele open`. Without it, Muse Spark answers instead.
BASETEN_API_KEY=
